  "description": "Medical speech-to-text model from Omi Health for transcribing clinical dialogue, built on NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2 (~0.6B params). Specialised for GP-style consultations, medication review, clinical dictation, and procedure/device/test language. Evaluated on 7.18 hours of real and synthetic clinical speech across dialogue, dictation, medication review, procedures/devices/tests, and general speech. Designed for local, on-device transcription; the canonical NeMo checkpoint is openly downloadable on Hugging Face with no gating, plus exportable MLX and GGUF variants. Explicitly not a diagnostic, triage, prescribing, or clinical-decision model — transcripts must be reviewed before any clinical use. CC-BY-4.0.",
